{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What kind of beings are humans to Sweets?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are the legendary, colossal, and invincible villains! Terrible demons who devour Sweets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sweets Devil</i>, our protagonist Renee faces off against these hostile Sweets in a series of fierce battles.But she\u2019s no helpless victim! Renee can transform into powerful forms to dominate the battlefield and embark on an unprecedented, joyful adventure of pummeling Sweets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/8f49163d51b539c1a094e33c13cb5ed7.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Hatties and transform into a dazzling Magical Girl!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! I\u2019m talking to you, Hattie of Darkness\u2014don\u2019t go dragging Renee into the abyss of greed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/5e64769e941b7444d9c9a93bbfcf9f37.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-hit kills! A stress-relieving &quot;hack-and-slash&quot; adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Sweets attack, knock 'em down one by one\u2014or take out the whole crowd at once! Remember to make good use of Hattie's protection mechanics to keep Renee safe from fatal blows.\u00a0If Renee gets knocked back too many times, she\u2019s going to get really angry! (And there's no calming her down!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/8574b9dab5671a96a3e72534693e42ff.poster.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/8574b9dab5671a96a3e72534693e42ff.webm?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08The Red Hattie\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/c77d2852c8b2473f9e77be7c61c3ffe4.poster.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/c77d2852c8b2473f9e77be7c61c3ffe4.webm?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/c77d2852c8b2473f9e77be7c61c3ffe4.mp4?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08The Black Hattie\uff09</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Read the room and &quot;treat&quot; every Sweet friend with care!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies who can\u2019t beat me... can be my friends! Face off against Sweets who've lost their will to fight and shake their final defenses.\u00a0Wicked threats, gentle soothing, or righteous arguments... which one will work best?\u00a0When it comes to making friends, Renee is absolutely enthusiastic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/12bd58abcb8b4e424bb5f00f60b36cfb.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Building: Extreme Fishing vs. Crepe Making!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cookie Town, a dreamlike playground with a sweet aesthetic!\u00a0Extreme Fishing: Can't catch the big one? Just blow them all up! Stun the fish with explosives, and they're as good as caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/b315eedae1ea754dff4d2533fce88525.poster.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/b315eedae1ea754dff4d2533fce88525.webm?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/b315eedae1ea754dff4d2533fce88525.mp4?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making Crepes: Create delicious Crepes according to customer orders! And once you\u2019re done, remember: the camera eats first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/fca44762115a0dfc60e21d12c6b69bb9.poster.avif?t=1771125625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/fca44762115a0dfc60e21d12c6b69bb9.webm?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/extras/fca44762115a0dfc60e21d12c6b69bb9.mp4?t=1771125625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282500?t=1771125625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771125625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/813b63c595c9b86f9515e20d9a2604dd6f6d2e16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771125625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282500/813b63c595c9b86f9